loop roomtone/beat
    volume 0.3

loop roomtone/radioplay
    volume 0.1

3 * oneshot ppiano/1 every 2to5
    volume 0.2
    move fly
    visual trail
    color yellow

3 * oneshot roomtone/guitar every 3to6
    volume 0.25
    move walk

loop ambience/rain
    volume 0.15
    visual sphere
    color blue